Divna Hanak is the interim leader of the [[Org/Althane/The First House|First House]] in [[Geography/Althane/Oresk/Sarengrad|Sarengrad]]. She holds the post until a replacement is assigned from [[Geography/Althane/Oresk/Kirov|Kirov]], and is not highly ranked.
